OL,3,AGreenland says findings on genocide
OL,4,Aallegation not final
OL,5,
OL,6,FGreenland's justice minister has said
OL,7,Fthe government cannot conclude whether
OL,8,Fgenocide was committed against the
OL,9,FInuit community after experts examined
OL,10,Fthe use of forced contraception in the
OL,11,F1960s and 70s.
OL,13,F"We cannot say, on behalf of the
OL,14,Fgovernment, whether there was
OL,15,Fgenocide," Marianne Paviasen told
OL,16,Freporters. "This is something we can
OL,17,Fcontinue to debate."
OL,23,APub: 28-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
