OL,3,AGreenland says findings on genocide
OL,4,Aallegation not final
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo reports on the practice were
OL,7,Freleased on Friday, a year after
OL,8,FDenmark apologised for the treatment of
OL,9,FInuit women and girls in its autonomous
OL,10,Fterritory.
OL,12,FGreenlandic Prime Minister
OL,13,FJens-Frederik Nielsen said a
OL,14,F"reconciliation commission" would be
OL,15,Fset up while Danish PM Mette
OL,16,FFrederiksen promised the governments
OL,17,Fwould work together.
